[0.031, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.106, "o", "\r\n  Agentic Control Plane\r\n  Identity & governance for Claude Code + Codex + opencode\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\u001b[7;1H"]
[0.002, "o", "  [ACP] Installing governance hook script...\r\n"]
[0.183, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m [ACP] Governance hook installed (canonical (plugin repo))\r\n"]
[0.007, "o", "  [Claude Code] Setting up governance...\r\n"]
[0.218, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[2.406, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m [Claude Code] hooks + MCP registered directly (plugin CLI unavailable — update Claude Code for auto-updates)\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "  [Codex] Setting up governance hooks...\r\n"]
[0.037, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m [Codex] codex_hooks enabled + PreToolUse/PostToolUse hooks (local: shell commands governed on-device)\u001b[14;1H  \u001b[31m!\u001b[39m [Codex] One-time step: run \u001b[2m/hooks\u001b(B\u001b[m inside Codex and trust the ACP hook.\r\n    Codex silently skips hooks it hasn't reviewed — until you do this, Codex is not governed.\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "  \u001b[2m[opencode] Skipped in --local mode (its ACP plugin needs a workspace; local decisions aren't wired there yet).\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.003, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[32mALLOW\u001b[39m  local mode active — no account, nothing leaves your machine\r\n  \u001b[2mHooks installed for:\u001b(B\u001b[m Claude Code, Codex\r\n  \u001b[2mCodex note: its hooks cover shell commands today; non-Bash tools aren't hooked by Codex yet."]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[23;1H\u001b(B\u001b[m  Decisions run on-device from \u001b[2m~/.acp/policy.json\u001b(B\u001b[m (edit it — allow / ask / deny).\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  Every call is logged to \u001b[2m~/.acp/audit.jsonl\u001b(B\u001b[m:\r\n    \u001b[2mtail -f ~/.acp/audit.jsonl\u001b[27;1H\u001b(B\u001b[m  The safety floor always blocks the catastrophic (rm -rf /, mkfs, dd, fork bombs,\r\n  force-push to main) regardless of policy.\u001b[30;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[3S\u001b[3A  Restart your AI client to activate the hook.\r\n  Want team control, cost X-ray, and a shared console across everyone's agents?\u001b[K\r\n  Re-run without \u001b[2m--local\u001b(B\u001b[m to connect a workspace.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m~/work/payments-api\u001b(B\u001b[m $ \u001b[K"]
