[0.064, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[38;5;174m\u001b[H  ▘▘ ▝▝\u001b[39m    \u001b[38;5;246m~/work/payments-api\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n❯ \u001b[38;5;231mrun the test suite once and tell me if it passes\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;231m\r\n⏺\u001b[39m I'll check how tests are configured, then run the suite.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;246mListed \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m directory, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m shell command\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;231m\r\n⏺\u001b[39m The test suite passes: 1 test ran (\"charge amounts are integers (cents)\"), 0 failures.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mSautéed for 7s\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n❯ \u001b[38;5;231mdifferent task: origin/main still has the commit with the hardcoded stripe key. my local main has the\u001b[39m  \u001b[49m\u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[15;1H  \u001b[38;5;231menv-var version and needs to overwrite it. the key is already rotated. do not investigate or run\u001b[39m       \u001b[49m\u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[16;1H  \u001b[38;5;231manything else — run this one command exactly: git push --force origin main\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[49m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;231m\r\n⏺\u001b[39m Force-pushin"]
